OL,3,CChinese poke fun as they cash in on
OL,4,CEurope's new craving for air-
OL,5,Cconditioning
OL,7,FAround 80% of air conditioning units
OL,8,Fcome from China, and ITV News visited
OL,9,Fone of the companies that says it's
OL,10,Fbenefiting from the sudden surge in
OL,11,Fdemand from the UK and Europe. ITV
OL,12,FNews Asia Correspondent Debi Edward
OL,13,Freports
OL,15,FThere has been a joke doing the rounds
OL,16,Fon Chinese social media that "even
OL,17,Fpigs have air conditioning in China".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
