FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1786738790
OL,3,CChinese poke fun as they cash in on
OL,4,CEurope's new craving for air-
OL,5,Cconditioning
OL,7,FSeveral memes have gone viral, poking
OL,8,Ffun at Europeans getting into fights
OL,9,Fover fans and portable AC units in
OL,10,Fsupermarkets amid sweltering
OL,11,Ftemperatures.
OL,13,FAround 65% of homes in China have AC,
OL,14,Fcompared to just 5% in the UK.
OL,16,FMost homes in Britain were built to
OL,17,Fretain warmth rather than stay cool,
OL,18,Fand it's only in recent years, due to
OL,19,Fsuccessive summer heatwaves, that many
OL,20,Fhave started to consider installing
OL,21,Fair conditioning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
