OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1786738790
OL,3,CChinese poke fun as they cash in on
OL,4,CEurope's new craving for air-
OL,5,Cconditioning
OL,7,FAnd guess which country produces most
OL,8,Fof the world's air conditioners?
OL,10,FAround 80% come from China, and ITV
OL,11,FNews visited one of the companies that
OL,12,Fsays it's benefiting from the sudden
OL,13,Fsurge in demand from the UK and Europe.
OL,15,FOn the production line at Haier in
OL,16,FQingdao, we watched workers assemble
OL,17,FAC units, fitting the internal fans,
OL,18,Fchecking the wiring and packaging them
OL,19,Fup, destined for what could be a
OL,20,Fgrowing export market.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1786738790
OL,3,CChinese poke fun as they cash in on
OL,4,CEurope's new craving for air-
OL,5,Cconditioning
OL,7,FThe factory manager told us that their
OL,8,Foutput could reach record levels this
OL,9,Fyear. Last year, they made 5 million
OL,10,Fair conditioners; only around 1.5
OL,11,Fmillion of them were sent to Europe.
OL,13,FThis year, they are already on track
OL,14,Fto double that.
OL,16,FHaier is just one of several Chinese
OL,17,Fcompanies that are enjoying a boost in
OL,18,Fbusiness from Europe. They've had to
OL,19,Fdraft in extra staff and extended
OL,20,Fshifts to cope with the additional
OL,21,Foutput.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1786738790
OL,3,CChinese poke fun as they cash in on
OL,4,CEurope's new craving for air-
OL,5,Cconditioning
OL,7,FWhat we saw being made were the wall-
OL,8,Fmounted air conditioners, which
OL,9,Frequire an external unit.
OL,11,FBut portable units are most popular in
OL,12,Fthe UK, mainly because of strict
OL,13,Fplanning and building restrictions
OL,14,Fwhich don't permit external wall
OL,15,Finstallations.
OL,17,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,18,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,19,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,20,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
