PN,31606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1786738790
OL,3,CChinese poke fun as they cash in on
OL,4,CEurope's new craving for air-
OL,5,Cconditioning
OL,7,FSocial media has been flooded with
OL,8,Fvideos of people debating how best to
OL,9,Fcool down their homes and how to get
OL,10,Faround the planning restrictions.
OL,12,FPart of the debate has been about the
OL,13,Fenergy efficiency of air conditioning.
OL,14,FEnvironmental groups have warned
OL,15,Fagainst the mass adoption of air con,
OL,16,Fsaying that the higher energy use
OL,17,Fcould worsen the climate problem.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1786738790
OL,3,CChinese poke fun as they cash in on
OL,4,CEurope's new craving for air-
OL,5,Cconditioning
OL,7,FI put those concerns to a senior
OL,8,Fofficial at the Haier Group, and he
OL,9,Fargued that if the extreme heat is
OL,10,Fcausing deaths, then air conditioning
OL,11,Fbecomes a necessity.
OL,13,FHe also claimed that the machines we'd
OL,14,Fseen being made in their factory were
OL,15,Fincreasingly energy efficient.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
