FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31608
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1786738790
OL,3,CChinese poke fun as they cash in on
OL,4,CEurope's new craving for air-
OL,5,Cconditioning
OL,7,FIf the forecasts prove right and
OL,8,Fheatwaves are to become the new norm,
OL,9,Fthen Chinese air-conditioning
OL,10,Fcompanies could soon be cashing in on
OL,11,FBritish households desperate to cool
OL,12,Ftheir homes.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/8
